  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Qin Bai Sheng’s auction, a bidder adds a sandalwood sacred elephant egg in a final effort against Immortal Gu offers. Onlookers say a sandalwood sacred elephant is an ancient desolate beast; after it grows to adulthood, it can rival rank seven Gu Immortals. They stress raising it from a young age to establish a deep relationship and lower the chance of betrayal, and call a living ancient desolate beast managed well a treasure trove of endless value.",
      "chapters": [
        754
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "auction-bid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The egg comes from a mysterious rank eight Gu Immortal of Eastern Sea and later falls into the hands of Chanyu tribe’s representative during the auction. Outside, He Lang Zi demands that the ambushed Chanyu Gu Immortal hand over the sandalwood sacred elephant egg.",
      "chapters": [
        764
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ambush-after-the-auction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "fac_chanyu_tribe",
        "char_he_lang_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Jiang Yu tells Chanyu Zhong Er’s captured soul that the sandalwood sacred elephant egg was also their target, but that compared with the fire path Immortal Gu it is only icing on the cake.",
      "chapters": [
        765
      ],
